cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "IsoformPocket: uncertainty-aware structural analysis of RAC1B"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Thomas
    given-names: Shane
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-20
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AlphaFold
  - bioinformatics
  - alternative splicing
  - protein structure
  - RAC1B
  - CTNND1
abstract: >-
  A reproducible structural analysis of isoform-dependent pockets and protein
  interaction surfaces using PKM1/PKM2 as a positive control and RAC1/RAC1B as
  the discovery system. Multi-seed AlphaFold complex predictions are evaluated
  against independent pocket detectors and experimental structures.
